# old-system Readonly Rules

`old-system/` is read-only reference material.

Allowed:

- Read files
- Search files
- Extract business rules
- Produce analysis in `docs/old-system-analysis/`

Forbidden:

- Edit old-system files
- Format old-system files
- Delete old-system files
- Install dependencies inside old-system
- Run old-system scripts that may write data
- Copy old-system code into frontend/backend

If old-system is referenced, report exactly which files were read.
